model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-08
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-06-30

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input wd: date

move pay: transfers
  on wd
  leg cash from world to konto amount amt

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 100.00 PLN "s"
  wd = window(2026-03-05, 2026-03-10) "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

version st
  cite s
  governs 2026-03-01..2026-03-07
  known 2026-03-08
  covers konto

ask a1: bal(konto, 2026-02-28)
ask a2: bal(konto, 2026-03-04)
ask a3: count(t in transfers over 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31)
ask a4_s1: count(t in transfers over 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31) with wd = 2026-03-05

ask a4_s2: count(t in transfers over 2026-03-01 .. 2026-03-31) with wd = 2026-03-08
ask a5: flows(pay, 2026-02)
